It need not be a tin, you get the same effect from eating monster corpses.
The general rule is that eating a corpse gives intrinsic that the monster
has when alive. Go on, try all the corpses you can find... (best to have
poison resistance - many corpses are poisonous). Also remember, that the
probability of gaining certain intrinsics from eating depends usually
on the monster level - for the weak ones you'll sometimes will have to eat
lots of them to gain intrinsics...
